WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
Some mistakes slip past a spellchecker because they’re real words in the wrong place.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:08.070
Affect is the action.

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:10.020
Effect is the result.

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:11.700
It’s means it is.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.120
Its shows something belongs.

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:18.170
When you’re not sure, say the long form out loud.

00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:20.870
If it sounds wrong, it is.
